
== A new database: every migration is applied, in order.
applied 0001_schemas_and_roles
applied 0002_refusals
applied 0003_working_tables
applied 0004_ledger
applied 0005_public_views
applied 0006_privileges
applied 0007_integrity_checks
applied 0008_widen_item_id
applied 0009_item_numbering
exit status 0

== Run again: there is nothing to apply.
nothing to apply
exit status 0

== What the database remembers: each version, and that it holds a checksum.
0001_schemas_and_roles  true
0002_refusals  true
0003_working_tables  true
0004_ledger  true
0005_public_views  true
0006_privileges  true
0007_integrity_checks  true
0008_widen_item_id  true
0009_item_numbering  true

== The recorded checksum of the first migration is the SHA-256 of its file.
same

== A later migration is added: only that one is applied.
applied 0900_sample_addition
exit status 0

== An applied migration has changed, if only by one blank line: refused.
E_PARSE: migration 0003_working_tables has changed since it was applied
exit status 1

== An applied migration is missing from this copy: refused.
E_NEEDS_SUBTOOL: the database holds migration 0900_sample_addition, which this copy of Logbook does not have
exit status 1

== A migration turns up that sorts before one already applied: refused.
E_PARSE: migration 0800_sample_latecomer was not applied, and the later migration 0900_sample_addition was
exit status 1

== A file that is not named like a migration: refused.
E_PARSE: the migrations directory holds a file that is not named like 0001_some_name.sql
exit status 1

== A migration with a badly formed name: refused.
E_PARSE: the migrations directory holds a file that is not named like 0001_some_name.sql
exit status 1

== A migration that fails part-way: refused, and nothing from it is kept.
E_PARSE: migration 0901_sample_half_done was not applied, and nothing from it was kept: division by zero
exit status 1
table from the failed migration exists: f
failed migration is recorded: f

== With the bad files gone, there is nothing to apply.
nothing to apply
exit status 0

== An empty migrations directory: refused.
E_PARSE: the migrations directory is empty
exit status 1

== A migrations directory that is not there: refused.
E_PARSE: the migrations directory cannot be read
exit status 1

== The database does not answer: refused, without naming where it was looked for.
E_TIMEOUT: the database did not answer
exit status 1

== The server is not PostgreSQL 17: refused.
E_NEEDS_SUBTOOL: these migrations are written for PostgreSQL 17 and the server is another version
exit status 1

== pub_ro already exists and may create databases: refused, and nothing is applied.
E_NEEDS_SUBTOOL: role pub_ro already exists with powers Logbook does not give it
exit status 1
schema core exists in that database: f

== pub_ro already exists and has been made a member of muster: refused.
E_NEEDS_SUBTOOL: role pub_ro already exists with powers Logbook does not give it
exit status 1

== With pub_ro as Logbook expects it, the same database is migrated.
applied 0001_schemas_and_roles
applied 0002_refusals
applied 0003_working_tables
applied 0004_ledger
applied 0005_public_views
applied 0006_privileges
applied 0007_integrity_checks
applied 0008_widen_item_id
applied 0009_item_numbering
exit status 0
